      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional requirements\n- CAP Theorem\n- DAU\n- latency\n- Scale (read/write requests)\n- for read requests, see if DB can handle the read\nrequests\n\n\nEg for URL shortner\n- 100M DAU\n- Read reqs = 100M DAU * 10 = 1B per day --> 10k RPS (so\nbecause of this, we need to scale DB as well) \n- 1 - 5 Billion total URL's",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional requirements\n- CAP Theorem\n- DAU\n- latency\n- Scale (read/write requests)\n- for read requests, see if DB can handle the read requests\n\n\nEg for URL shortner\n- 100M DAU\n- Read reqs = 100M DAU * 10 = 1B per day --> 10k RPS (so because of this, we need to scale DB as well) \n- 1 - 5 Billion total URL's",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
